{"meta":{"id":"language-benchmark","category":"it/programming-languages/performance","title":"언어별 성능 비교","subtitle":"","summary":"C, Java, Python, PHP, Node(js) 성능 비교","tags":["성능","c","java","python","php","node"],"color":"violet","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-violet","source":"blog: etc/LanguageTest.jsx","updatedAt":"2024-05-13"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-violet-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-violet-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-violet-50 text-violet-700 border border-violet-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></span>BENCHMARK</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2024-05-13</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">언어별 성능 비교</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-violet-50/70 border border-violet-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-violet-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> C, Java, Python, PHP, Node(js) 성능 비교</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5 border-b border-stone-100\">\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">코드 온라인 IDE ( <a href=\"https://www.mycompiler.io/ko\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-violet-700 font-semibold underline underline-offset-2\">mycompiler</a>)</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">1부터 1백만까지의 합을 구하는 시간 비교</p>\r\n<p class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-violet-700 font-semibold\">참고: python 100회시 15초 초과로 10회 테스트</p>\r\n<div class=\"my-3 border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">순번</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">언어</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">평균 실행 시간 [ms]</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">1</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">JAVA</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">02.2</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">2</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">C</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">02.929300</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">3</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">NodeJS</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">22.1649</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">4</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">PHP</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">82.0398</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">5</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">Python</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">512.1319</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">의외로 JAVA 잴 빨랐다...</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">C가 잴 빠르다고 생각했었는데, 이상해서 사이트의 문제를 생각하고 개인 PC로 C와 JAVA 재비교</p>\r\n<div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-violet-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">100회 반복 후 평균으로 비교</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"my-3 border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">순번</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">언어</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">평균 실행 시간 [ms]</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">1</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">C(release)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">0.11</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">2</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">JAVA</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">0.23</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">3</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">C(debug)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-stone-700 align-top\">0.43</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\r\n<p class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-800 font-semibold\">결론</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">덧셈이란 기본적인 비교인 경우, C를 release모드로 동작하는 게 아니라면, JAVA가 더 빠르다</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">(포인터를 사용하는 형태를 구현하면, 달라질 것같다)</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5 border-b border-stone-100\">\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">C</p>\r\n<div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">c</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\r\n#include &lt;time.h&gt;\r\n\r\nint main() {\r\n  int repeatCnt = 10;\r\n  clock_t startTime, endTime;\r\n  double tactTime, totalTime = 0;\r\n  long long sum = 0;\r\n\r\n  for (int j = 0; j &lt; repeatCnt; j++) {\r\n    sum = 0;\r\n    startTime = clock();\r\n    for (int i = 1; i &lt;= 1000000; i++) {\r\n        sum += i;\r\n    }\r\n    endTime = clock();\r\n\r\n    tactTime = ((double)(endTime - startTime)) / CLOCKS_PER_SEC * 1000;\r\n    totalTime += tactTime;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  double averageTime = totalTime / repeatCnt;\r\n\r\n  printf(&quot;sum : %lld\\n&quot;, sum);\r\n  printf(&quot;평균 시간 : %f [ms]\\n&quot;, averageTime);\r\n\r\n  return 0;\r\n}</pre></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5 border-b border-stone-100\">\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">java</p>\r\n<div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">public class Main {\r\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\r\n    int repeatCnt = 10;\r\n    long sum = 0;\r\n    double totalTime = 0;\r\n\r\n    for (int j = 0; j &lt; repeatCnt; j++) {\r\n      sum = 0;\r\n      long startTime = System.currentTimeMillis();\r\n      for (int i = 1; i &lt;= 1000000; i++) {\r\n        sum += i;\r\n      }\r\n      long endTime = System.currentTimeMillis();\r\n      totalTime += (endTime - startTime);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    double averageTime = totalTime / repeatCnt;\r\n\r\n    System.out.println(&quot;sum : &quot; + sum);\r\n    System.out.println(&quot;평균 시간 : &quot; + averageTime + &quot; [ms]&quot;);\r\n  }\r\n}</pre></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5 border-b border-stone-100\">\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">python</p>\r\n<div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">python</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">import time\r\n\r\nrepeatCnt = 10\r\ntotalTime = 0\r\nsum = 0\r\n\r\nfor x in range(repeatCnt):\r\n  sum = 0\r\n  startTime = time.time()\r\n  for i in range(1, 1000001):\r\n    sum += i\r\n  endTime = time.time()\r\n  totalTime += (endTime - startTime) * 1000\r\n\r\naverageTime = totalTime / repeatCnt\r\n\r\nprint(f&quot;sum : {sum}&quot;)\r\nprint(f&quot;평균 시간 : {averageTime:.4f} [ms]&quot;)</pre></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5 border-b border-stone-100\">\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">php</p>\r\n<div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">php</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">      &lt;?php\r\n      $repeatCnt = 10;\r\n      $totalTime = 0;\r\n      $sum = 0;\r\n\r\n      for ($j = 0; $j &lt; $repeatCnt; $j++) {\r\n        $sum = 0;\r\n        $startTime = microtime(true);\r\n        for ($i = 1; $i &lt;= 1000000; $i++) {\r\n          $sum += $i;\r\n        }\r\n        $endTime = microtime(true);\r\n        $totalTime += ($endTime - $startTime) * 1000;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      $averageTime = $totalTime / $repeatCnt;\r\n      $averageTime = number_format($averageTime, 4);\r\n\r\n      echo &quot;sum : $sum\r\n&quot;;\r\n      echo &quot;평균 시간 : $averageTime [ms]\r\n&quot;;\r\n      ?&gt;</pre></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5\">\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Node js</p>\r\n<div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">let repeatCnt = 10;\r\nlet totalTime = 0;\r\nlet sum = 0;\r\n\r\nfor (let j = 0; j &lt; repeatCnt; j++) {\r\n  sum = 0;\r\n  const startTime = performance.now();\r\n  for (let i = 1; i &lt;= 1000000; i++) {\r\n    sum += i;\r\n  }\r\n  const endTime = performance.now();\r\n  totalTime += (endTime - startTime);\r\n}\r\n\r\nconst averageTime = totalTime / repeatCnt;\r\n\r\nconsole.log(`sum : ${sum}`);\r\nconsole.log(`평균 시간 : ${averageTime.toFixed(4)} [ms]`);</pre></div>\r\n</div>\r\n","path":"it/programming-languages/performance/language-benchmark","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"programming-languages","title":"프로그램 언어","path":"it/programming-languages"},{"id":"performance","title":"성능 테스트","path":"it/programming-languages/performance"}],"hasImage":false}